## Open Blockers & Known Notes

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **`RESEND_API_KEY`** must be configured in the Convex dashboard environment variables for email delivery to function. Without it, email dispatch silently skips — no error thrown.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **`SESSION_SECRET`** must be set in `.env` (or Cloudflare Pages env vars) for HMAC session signing. Minimum 32 characters. Example: `openssl rand -base64 32`

> [!WARNING]
> **`CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT`** must be set and `npx convex dev` run at least once to populate `convex/_generated/api.ts` before deploying. The file currently exists as a stub.

> [!NOTE]
> The **`adapter-cloudflare` IDE false positive** in the Svelte language server is a stale-cache issue. The package is installed and the build confirms it works. Fix: `Ctrl+Shift+P → Svelte: Restart Language Server`.

